<title>MALAYSIA: Proton chief dies in air crash-Bernama.</title>
<headline>Proton chief dies in air crash-Bernama.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman and chief executive officer of national carmaker Proton Bhd and his wife were among three people killed in a helicopter crash on Monday night, an official at Proton's parent DRB-Hicom confirmed to national Bernama news agency.</p>
<p>Yahaya Ahmad and his wife Rohana Osman died in the crash near Kuala Lipis, about 250 km from Kuala Lumpur, Bernama said on Tuesday. Officials at Proton, Diversified Resources Bhd (DRB) and Hicom Holdings Bhd, which Yahaya controlled, and at the Department of Civil Aviation, were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
